    "text": "By Lucas Warren ,\n6 hours ago Firefighters were on the scene of a house fire in an Edmond neighborhood northeast of Coltrane Road and Second Street early Wednesday, working amid an apparent water main break that sent muddy water spilling across part of the road. Sky 5 footage showed light smoke coming from the home as crews worked the scene. Read full article",
